// REJECTS: Field 'class' is required
//
// A classView requires class, position AND rectangle. missing-required-classview-rectangle
// .pure omits the geometry; this omits the REFERENCE, which is the field that decides what
// the view is a view of.
//
// Both are worth having because they prove the check is per-field rather than a count. The
// message names 'class' specifically, and it comes from the walker after the tree is built
// -- the grammar itself is happy with any subset of the three, in any order. A generated
// parser reproduces the grammar exactly and enforces none of this.
###Diagram
Diagram fixture::neg::NoClass
{
   classView v1
   {
      position: (1.0,2.0);
      rectangle: (10.0,20.0);
   }
}
